 "note": "In-hand overlays: 46x46, 30 frames, same layout/origin as sheets_pixel/hero_strip.png. HIDE THE DEFAULT SWORD: draw baseNoBlade (hero with its blade pixels removed) instead of hero_strip.png when a signature weapon is equipped; the grip hand is repainted inside each weapon strip so the weapon sits in the fist. Weapon length = loot.js swL + 2px grip. Frames 17-23 grip/tip were hand-placed; others auto-tracked from the hero blade. Frames 24-25 (white hit flash) reuse frame 23's pose and get the same flash tint. Icons: 12x12 to match assets/ui/flask_icon.png & souls_icon.png (the only bitmap inventory-size icons in av-art; inventory items are otherwise drawn in code), plus a 24x24 @2x. heavy_<id>.png: 6 frames of 48x48, flat 2-colour arc + one small motif, 1px dark outline, no glow; origin [0.25,0.75] = at the hero's hand, facing right (flip for left)."
}